Data
----

* Administrative boundaries (ZBGIS) -- (c) Úrad geodézie, kartografie a
  katastra Slovenskej republiky (ÚGKK SR), CC BY 4.0.
  https://opendata.skgeodesy.sk/

* Borders of the countries around Slovakia -- Natural Earth (admin 0
  countries, 1:10m, v5.1.2), public domain. https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

* Roads, railways, waters and buildings of the base map -- (c) OpenStreetMap
  contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, from Geofabrik's extract
  of Slovakia of 1 January 2026. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  The base map files (data/build/base/, base/ on the site) are a derived
  database of it: roads, railways, waterways and water areas selected,
  simplified and cut per okres, and building outlines rounded and grouped
  per obec, by src/election_map_slovakia/basemap.py.
  They are published under the ODbL 1.0 as well:
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

* Address register with coordinates -- Ministerstvo vnútra Slovenskej
  republiky (MV SR), CC0 1.0. https://data.slovensko.sk/

* Candidate lists of the 2026 municipal and regional elections -- (c) MV SR,
  published at https://www.minv.sk/; redistributed in derived form.

* Election results and the territorial division of the elections (the
  final results of 2022 to 2026 and the okrsky of 2026) -- Štatistický
  úrad Slovenskej republiky (ŠÚ SR), published at https://volbysr.sk/ and
  https://volby.statistics.sk/; redistributed in derived form.

* data/curated/elections/*/obvody/ -- constituency membership transcribed
  from the official decisions of the eight self-governing regions and of
  the cities of Bratislava and Košice (each file names its source
  document); official documents, redistributed in derived form.

* Party logos in web/img/parties/ -- each with its source and licence
  (and author, where the licence requires attribution) in
  config/parties.toml.

* config/blocklist-konspiratori.txt -- a dated snapshot of the list
  published at https://www.konspiratori.sk/zoznam-stranok.

